  "fixed_source_decisions": [
    "Durable breadth and narrow turn context.",
    "One conservative weak-model-safe automated contract; measured InstructionLoad, tokens, adapter behavior, and outcomes remain diagnostics, not predicted or per-model safety budgets.",
    "Direct Assistant Chat and Chat-originated delegation are distinct from each other and from ordinary strict-policy automation.",
    "Deterministic Context Admission precedes PromptCapsule, RuntimePolicySnapshot, and explanatory ContextReceipt; provider rendering precedes independent Packet Admission and FileSafe over identical final bytes; dispatch is immutable; ordinary execution has one assigned worker call; response conformance is deterministic.",
    "BSD is optional and default Off.",
    "Provider CLI first acquisition is explicit, official-source based, bound to the exact Host/Environment, and separate from authentication; Auto or On only maintains an already approved installation.",
    "No Playwright-shaped Puppet Master runtime and no SQLite sidecar.",
    "The former exact 8-low/2-high cohort, A-E method, and post-V4 recipe are superseded.",
    "Historical task 019fc3fd-4061-7d01-9c22-a3c82f34de1f is terminal at STOPPED_BEFORE_SUBJECT_LAUNCH and supports no empirical result."
